    "pre_update_notes": "A patch release on top of 2.3.3: a blank or half-drawn admin page after a menu click now reloads itself, the SEO Health and Manufacturers pages are counted in the background so they open fast after an update or a cache clear, deleted migration packages leave the list at once and closed share links can be removed, and the admin now records evidence when a page reaches the browser incomplete (so the cause can be found on your server). One small database change adds a setting; nothing in your products, orders, invoices, payments or customers is changed or removed. Update from a single browser tab and leave the update page open until it finishes.",
    "post_update_notes": "After the update: use the admin for a few days as usual. If a page ever stays blank, it reloads by itself and one line is written to storage/logs/slow-admin-<date>.log; send that file for analysis. Settings > Performance has a new switch, Fast page switching in the admin (on by default); switch it off to load full pages instead.",
